                                "sense_id": "0517a71c-d861-3cda-9070-eb218d2aacfe",
                                "text": "Die Befragten bewerten die Regierungsarbeit zunehmend kritischer, aber in der Sonntagsfrage wirkt sich dies bisher wenig aus.",
                                "translation": "The respondents judge the government’s work more and more critically, but this has as yet little influence on party preference.",
                                "english": "The respondents judge the government’s work more and more critically, but this has as yet little influence on party preference."
